# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms — https://web3forms.com)
# Create an access key using the client's inbox (lorelaisamson@gmail.com) so
# inquiries are emailed to her. The key is public by design, hence NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the key; add both to Vercel too.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
